// Count of kept winning labeled hammings strictly above the upper central value.
// An empty above-set returns -1, not 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE huhcn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG huhcn rank

IMPULSE huhcn 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "huhcn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
